  stars perfect for holiday tree ornaments\, gift toppers\, or festive wind
 ow decorations. Whether you are an experienced paper crafter or completely
  new to the fold\, step-by-step guidance will be provided. All paper and s
 upplies are included-- just bring your patience and creativity!\n\nPrice: 
